{"data": {"event": {"id": "f2862297-a0bb-4311-9782-940910f5784d", "picture": null, "sessionType": "S\u00e9ance de cas cliniques", "sessionTypeColor": "#44fce7", "voting": true, "title": "S\u00e9ance de cas cliniques :\u00a0 qu'est ce que tu as encore mang\u00e9 ?", "start": "2026-10-10T15:30+02:00", "end": "2026-10-10T16:30+02:00", "objectives": ["<p>Quatre bin\u00f4mes compos\u00e9s chacun d'un junior et d'un senior pr\u00e9senteront un dossier clinique didactique.<br>", "Les pr\u00e9sentations incluront des quizz interactifs permettant au public de voter et de tenter de d\u00e9jouer les pi\u00e8ges des cas cliniques pr\u00e9sent\u00e9s. Cette participation active vise \u00e0 enrichir l'apprentissage et \u00e0 favoriser la discussion.<br>", "Chaque pr\u00e9sentation de cas sera suivie d'une mise au point th\u00e9orique approfondie sur le th\u00e8me abord\u00e9, permettant de consolider les connaissances et de r\u00e9pondre aux questions soulev\u00e9es.</p>"], "onAir": null, "vod": {"checkPermissions": ["media:view"], "media": null}, "broadcasts": {"items": []}, "room": {"id": "ec511c62-e506-449e-98de-bdc85330f8d5", "name": "Amphith\u00e9\u00e2tre bleu", "type": "ROOM"}, "schedule": {"items": [{"id": "c7f5bb93-b78f-45c9-a1e3-8a02ffc08338", "title": "Dossiers comment\u00e9s", "start": "2026-10-10T15:30+02:00", "end": "2026-10-10T15:45+02:00", "element": {"abstract": null}, "speakers": {"items": [{"id": "ef6363e4-61a0-44b3-b8d1-942ff6e7efab", "lastName": "Marier", "firstName": "Zo\u00e9", "roles": [{"name": "speaker"}], "photo": null, "country": {"name": "France"}, "city": {"name": "Angers"}}, {"id": "4861036b-54ab-4182-a87d-73628076bab8", "lastName": "Delagnes", "firstName": "Anais", "roles": [{"name": "speaker"}], "photo": {"url": "https://services.y-congress.com/congress/wspreview/getphoto.aspx?idPhoto=234921&t=1"}, "country": {"name": "France"}, "city": {"name": "Angers"}}]}, "vod": {"checkPermissions": ["media:view"], "media": null}}, {"id": "9e6f3f59-6a4e-41e6-8